WARNING: "ewma_init" [/home/alberix2/Desktop/backports-3.13.2-1/net/mac8021=
1/mac80211.ko] undefined!
WARNING: "ewma_add" [/home/alberix2/Desktop/backports-3.13.2-1/net/mac80211=
/mac80211.ko] undefined!
So If keep these warnings I cannot install the module to the system linux 3=
.2.36: these errors I saw from the command "dmesg":
